:: Bunker Rat
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if $finish is 1>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bunker Rat Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bunker Rat Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bunker Rat Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bunker Rat]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Bunker Rat Finish
<<effects>>

<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You manage to defeat the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> flees deeper into the bunker.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bunker]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> moves away from you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Bunker]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bunker]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bunker Spider
<<effects>>

<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>

	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<set $enemytype to "swarm">>
	<<swarminit "spiders" "sac" "slipping" "break" "steady" 1 9>>
	<<set $timer to 30>>
<</if>>

<<if $timer gte 25>>
The old steel above the web creak. If this keeps up they'll break.
<<elseif $timer gte 20>>
Shards break from the ceiling.
<<elseif $timer gte 10>>
The steel continues to break down.
<<elseif $timer gte 1>>
The steel ceiling creaks ominously.
<<else>>
A steel beam breaks from the ceiling and the web tumbles to the ground.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<swarmeffects>>
<<swarm>>
<<swarmactions>>

<<if $timer lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bunker Spider Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bunker Spider]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Bunker Spider Finish
<<effects>>

Startled by the collapse, the spiders flee into whatever hiding place they came from. <<tearful>> you struggle to your feet and peel the remaining web from your body.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>

<<pass 1 hour>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[Next|Bunker]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>